  abstract    = {Using two independent mobile phone app datasets covering three years in the Glasgow City Region, we build a framework to estimate park visitation and map park usage across socio-demographic groups. Preliminary findings highlight the potential of mobile phone app data for providing scalable, highly granular insights into park usage, while also revealing inherent challenges.}
}

